      "content": "but rest doesn't fix anything. it's just a temporary break before everything gets heavy again. i look at my mom or my brother and i see how much stress i cause them just by existing, by needing things, by being a mess. it feels like if i wasn't here, they could finally have the peace they deserve. wouldn't it be better if i just wasn't a part of the equation anymore? like, wouldn't everything just be easier for them if i wasn't around to mess it all up?",
